  "_note": "v1.3 = v1.2 plus a reconcile check: the file's own declared grand total must equal the sum of the rows the recipe treats as data. Catches a subtotal row without knowing what its label MEANS -- the evidence is arithmetic the provider put in the file. Adds numbers only; never branches on what a cell says.",
  "sheets": [
